  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 401.01 Continuing education course",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 401.01 “Continuing education course” means a course approved by the mechanical licensing board for the further education of licensed fuel gas fitters and plumbers in New Hampshire. The course shall be based on adopted laws, rules, codes and standards that have a direct effect on the specific licensure program for which they have been designed.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15",
